    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EGO LEAGUE</strong> is a <strong><i>skill-based</i></strong> football game with <strong><i>overpowered abilities</i></strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No player switching, no automation, just you, your skills, and a battlefield full of players all hungry to devour your ego. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your worth through raw mechanics and decision-making. Every <strong>dribble</strong>, <strong>shot</strong>, and <strong>pass</strong> is controlled by you. There are no assists, no automatic actions, just real-time skill and split-second decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build  your <strong>ego</strong> by crafting your own <strong>unique playstyle</strong>, selecting insane abilities that enhance core gameplay. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shooting (<i>Kicks, Headers, Bicycle-Kicks</i>)</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All forms of shooting are charged with left click. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flick vertically for height, horizontally for curve.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.poster.avif?t=1752641577\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.webm?t=1752641577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.mp4?t=1752641577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dribbling</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you hold, the more power you put into each touch. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the ball with precision or risk being overwhelmed by opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.poster.avif?t=1752641577\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.webm?t=1752641577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.mp4?t=1752641577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapping (receiving passes)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use middle click to absorb incoming passes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time it right and you gain control. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcharge and you risk losing momentum, giving your opponent the chance to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.poster.avif?t=1752641577\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.webm?t=1752641577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.mp4?t=1752641577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With endless ways to shoot, from precise curls to high-power rockets, and countless combinations of insane abilities, every match is a new chance to evolve, dominate, and prove whose ego reigns supreme.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: Gameplay footage shown is from early development and is highly subject to change.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EGO LEAGUE</strong> is a <strong><i>skill-based</i></strong> football game with <strong><i>overpowered abilities</i></strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No player switching, no automation, just you, your skills, and a battlefield full of players all hungry to devour your ego. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your worth through raw mechanics and decision-making. Every <strong>dribble</strong>, <strong>shot</strong>, and <strong>pass</strong> is controlled by you. There are no assists, no automatic actions, just real-time skill and split-second decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build  your <strong>ego</strong> by crafting your own <strong>unique playstyle</strong>, selecting insane abilities that enhance core gameplay. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shooting (<i>Kicks, Headers, Bicycle-Kicks</i>)</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All forms of shooting are charged with left click. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flick vertically for height, horizontally for curve.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.poster.avif?t=1752641577\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.webm?t=1752641577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.mp4?t=1752641577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dribbling</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you hold, the more power you put into each touch. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the ball with precision or risk being overwhelmed by opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.poster.avif?t=1752641577\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.webm?t=1752641577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.mp4?t=1752641577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapping (receiving passes)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use middle click to absorb incoming passes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time it right and you gain control. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcharge and you risk losing momentum, giving your opponent the chance to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.poster.avif?t=1752641577\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.webm?t=1752641577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.mp4?t=1752641577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With endless ways to shoot, from precise curls to high-power rockets, and countless combinations of insane abilities, every match is a new chance to evolve, dominate, and prove whose ego reigns supreme.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: Gameplay footage shown is from early development and is highly subject to change.</p>",
    "short_description": "A competitive, skill-based football game where you control a single player. Master precise movement, dribbling, and shooting mechanics, and compete in fast-paced, online multiplayer team matches. Build your ego by equipping powerful, customizable abilities that define your unique playstyle.",
